---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="예약·신청 · 한국가톨릭문화원">
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="text-wine text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-semibold mb-3">RESERVATIONS</div>
    <h1 class="serif text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-12">예약 · 신청 · 문의</h1>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <a href="#" class="group block p-8 bg-white border border-ink/10 hover:border-wine transition shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-2">GOOGLE FORM</div>
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl mb-3 group-hover:text-wine transition">공연 예약</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">정기연주회 · 공연 · 미사 참석 사전 신청.</p>
        <div class="text-wine text-sm">신청하러 가기 →</div>
      </a>

      <a href="#" class="group block p-8 bg-white border border-ink/10 hover:border-wine transition shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-2">FORMSPREE</div>
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl mb-3 group-hover:text-wine transition">공간 대관</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">실비아홀 · 바울라홀 · 갤러리 대관 문의.</p>
        <div class="text-wine text-sm">문의하러 가기 →</div>
      </a>

      <a href="#" class="group block p-8 bg-white border border-ink/10 hover:border-wine transition shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-2">GOOGLE CALENDAR</div>
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl mb-3 group-hover:text-wine transition">단체 관람</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">본당·학교·단체 방문 및 투어 예약.</p>
        <div class="text-wine text-sm">예약하러 가기 →</div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 p-8 bg-ivory border-l-4 border-gold">
      <div class="text-gold font-semibold text-sm mb-2">🚧 준비 중</div>
      <p class="text-ink/70 text-sm">각 신청서의 실제 URL(Google 폼·Formspree·Calendar 링크)은 Phase 2에서 연결됩니다. 그동안은 대표번호 <b>1577-3217</b> 또는 <b>info@koccc.kr</b>로 문의해 주세요.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
